Package: genevintage
Title: Identify the Build Annotation Associated with a Set of Gene
    Identifiers
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Genevintage detects the species from the
    identifier prefixes and ranks the 'Ensembl' or 'GENCODE' releases consistent
    with the set, then converts the identifiers to gene names. It also supports
    methods to retrieve gene by class (mitochondrial, sex-linked,
    protein-coding, ribosomal, transfer RNA, long non-coding RNA) and mapping
    genes to their orthologs in another species.
